A||||1||Lynx||Trans dosent want to go into first and second!
Z||000000||Lynx||05-14-99||12:32 AM||||Ok when ever i try to put my 85 5speed (2m4) it it wont go in most of the time with out hitting it in. Now i think i might beable to solve the problem but i dont know much about the linkage's. Ok i was looking on the transmission where the linkage hookes up to a poll sticking out. When you want to shift into first and second the poll has to pull out of the transmission but it dosent do that without forcing it into gear, if i actaully pull on it with my fingers and have someone shift is goes right into gear. Im curious if there is supposed to be a spring here or something (there isnt one) to help pull out on it when it has to shift.<p>Thanks for any info.<br>Lynx
Z||000001||Lynx||05-14-99||03:09 AM||||NEVERMIND, Im dumb and didnt pay attention. I just looked and saw the other cable pulled a lever that pulled the shaft out. All i had to do was adjust the cable on that lever so it would pull out farther. It works PERFECT now. All that time of jerking the shifter for no reason. Also dose anybody know what the plug is for beside the shaft, is it to lube the shaft?
